@startuml cu37
!theme plain
title CU37 — Eliminar concepto

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to delete a concept.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Presents a list of every available concept.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects one and confirms its deletion.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Deletes the indicated concept.
System -> System : System

@enduml